<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia considering easing media rules-Howard.</title>
<headline>Australia considering easing media rules-Howard.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard on Thursday confirmed the government was looking at allowing television proprietors to own one newspaper each in major capital city markets.</p>
<p>&quot;A whole lot of things including that is being looked at, a whole lot of things,&quot; Howard told radio 2UE.</p>
</text>
